From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] sheng: boot-gated panic text on retained linear scanout

Ported from Pad 8 Pro (0073-panic-text.patch), adapted for sheng's 3048x2032 scanout
(dynamic scale = 4 for >=2560x1600, 5 for >=3200x2000) and UniXNU's #if defined(__arm64__).
Requires piano-panic-text=1 boot argument; draws at kdp_machine_reboot_type / panic-hold.

---
